flowchart TB
    subgraph Users ["Developer Workspace"]
        Dev["Developer / Student<br/>(Browsing at :3000)"]
    end

    subgraph ClientBoundary ["Client Runtime (Browser)"]
        SPA["BugBuddy Web App<br/>(React 18 + Vite 5 SPA)"]
        LocalStore["Local Storage<br/>(Versioned Profile, Quests, XP)"]
        ClientOffline["Client Deterministic Engine<br/>(Zero-Network Fallback)"]
    end

    subgraph ServerBoundary ["Backend Service (Node.js on :3001)"]
        HTTPServer["HTTP Server (`src/server/index.ts`)<br/>Port 3001 / HOST 0.0.0.0"]
        AIRouter["API Router (`src/server/aiRouter.ts`)<br/>POST /api/diagnose | 64KB Limit | CORS"]
        Orchestrator["AIDebugOrchestrator<br/>(Evidence Grounding & Fallback)"]
        HybridEngine["Hybrid Search Engine<br/>(BM25 + RRF Reciprocal Rank Fusion)"]
        BM25Index["In-Memory BM25 Index<br/>(60 Curated Records, 6 Languages)"]
        VectorIndex["VectorSearchIndex<br/>(ONNX Dense Vectors / 384-dim)"]
        ProviderRegistry["AI Provider Registry<br/>(Gemini, OpenAI, Mock)"]
    end

    subgraph ExternalProviders ["Server-Side External Cloud AI"]
        GeminiAPI["Google Gemini REST API<br/>(gemini-2.5-flash / gemini-1.5-flash)"]
        OpenAIAPI["OpenAI Chat API<br/>(gpt-4o-mini / gpt-4o)"]
    end

    Dev -->|Visits UI / Submits Code| SPA
    SPA <-->|Reads / Writes Stats| LocalStore
    SPA -.->|Offline / Network Error| ClientOffline
    SPA -->|POST /api/diagnose| HTTPServer

    HTTPServer --> AIRouter
    AIRouter --> Orchestrator
    Orchestrator --> HybridEngine
    HybridEngine --> BM25Index
    HybridEngine --> VectorIndex
    Orchestrator --> ProviderRegistry

    ProviderRegistry -->|GEMINI_API_KEY| GeminiAPI
    ProviderRegistry -->|OPENAI_API_KEY| OpenAIAPI
    ProviderRegistry -.->|Fallback to Curated Evidence| BM25Index
